WEBVTT

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:10.525
AI assistants already shop for people. Now they can buy from your store.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.270
This is APIbase Integrator.

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.700
Connect your shop in three quick steps —

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.450
your store,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.630
the agreements,

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.260
and your wallet.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.014
No payment. No gas.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.180
You get your own page on APIbase.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.590
Paste one link on your site —

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:42.738
Shopify, WooCommerce, Wix, Tilda, or plain HTML.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:54.090
Now a shopper tells their AI agent what to buy.

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:58.416
The agent finds your product, gets a quote, and pays in USDC.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.490
The money settles straight to your wallet, on Base or Tempo.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:08.066
Zero percent fee during the pilot.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.540
Let AI agents buy from your store.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.532
Connect at apibase.pro slash integrator.
